  "decision_rationale": [
    "Deterministic indexed flip, noise/recompression, and rotation patterns prove original-to-derivative lineage across the provider boundary.",
    "Exact byte duplicates and pHash links touch 99.41% of test images, invalidating an independent test interpretation.",
    "Exact and perceptual components cross provider class labels, including product-relevant maize and tomato contradictions.",
    "The train encoding is standardized and metadata-stripped relative to test, enabling a partition-domain shortcut.",
    "Pakistan public data cannot establish performance in Nepal."
  ],
  "prohibited_uses": [
    "Any prepared manifest before remediation",
    "Provider train/test evaluation",
    "Validation or calibration evidence",
    "Independent internal or external test evidence",
    "Nepal field evidence",
    "Model selection, promotion, deployment, or phone-installation claims"
  ],
  "safe_handling": [
    "Preserve both raw provider archives unchanged for provenance but exclude every train-tree image from prepared manifests and runs.",
    "Discard the provider partition boundary and retain the test tree only as original candidates.",
    "Before any admission, group exact duplicates, perceptual derivatives, and capture bursts and quarantine every mixed-label component in full.",
    "Complete privacy, rights, and representative agronomist review, especially for maize and tomato class contradictions.",
    "Assign every admitted original to a training-only group before generating reproducible on-the-fly augmentation.",
    "Map only adjudicated maize and tomato conditions; consider other species only as reviewed wrong-crop or OOD evidence.",
    "Re-run the fail-closed manifest audit and create a new immutable admission receipt before any experiment."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "DCT pHash can miss strong rotations and can occasionally link visually similar but unrelated images; it is not a label adjudicator.",
    "The fourth indexed augmentation slot was manually confirmed as rotation in representative sequences but was not corpus-wide angle-normalized.",
    "This review performs lineage and integrity analysis, not agronomic diagnosis verification.",
    "No conclusion about Nepal field performance can be drawn from this Pakistan corpus."
  ]
}
